FORUM: Future-Oriented Representation and Uncertainty Modeling

Algorithm source
----------------
This implementation follows the supplied manuscript:
"Beyond Reward Accuracy: Latent World Modeling for Offline Reinforcement
Learning in Recommendation", Sections 4.1-4.4, Algorithm 1 and Section 5.2.
See docs/paper_alignment.md for the equation mapping and implementation choices.
The manuscript and its figures are not redistributed in this repository.
The manuscript's placeholder performance tables are not measured code results.

Code provenance
---------------
The Python implementation was developed for this project with AI assistance.
It does not vendor or import SGAR, CODI, DORL or RL4Rec source code. The generic
ML components use NumPy and PyTorch; those projects retain their own licenses.
The MIT license applies to this repository's code, not external datasets,
models, manuscripts or third-party software.

Optional evaluation data
------------------------
Coat data must be supplied separately. The optional Coat evaluator checks the
fingerprint of the completed RL4Rec simulation matrix published at:
https://github.com/BetsyHJ/RL4Rec/blob/main/data/coat_pseudoGT_ratingM.ascii
This file is a completed simulator matrix, not a fully observed human-rating
dataset. Dataset permissions and upstream attribution remain applicable.
No data, pretrained weights or experiment outputs are distributed here.
